INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `pageName`, `content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1, 'refund policy', '<p>At Mediboy, we prioritize customer satisfaction and aim to provide high-quality healthcare products. However, we understand that there might be instances where a refund or return is necessary. This policy outlines the conditions under which users can request a refund and return a product.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>1. Refund and Return Policy</strong></p><p>We offer a refund or return policy under the following conditions:</p><ul><li><strong>Inspection Upon Delivery</strong>: When the product is delivered by our delivery partner, users are required to inspect the product immediately for any issues such as damage, defects, or incorrect items. If any issues are found, the user must inform the delivery man on the spot.</li><li><strong>Return and Refund Requests</strong>: Users can request a return and refund <strong>only at the time of delivery</strong> if the product is damaged, defective, or incorrect. After the delivery is completed and the user accepts the product, returns and refunds will not be possible.</li></ul><p><strong>2. Non-Refundable and Non-Returnable Items</strong></p><p>The following items are <strong>non-refundable and non-returnable</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>Frozen Products</strong>: Any product that requires freezing, including vaccines or certain medicines, cannot be returned or refunded.</li><li><strong>Consumed Products</strong>: Once a product has been used or consumed, it is not eligible for return or refund, for safety and hygiene reasons.</li><li><strong>Prescription Medications</strong>: Products that require a prescription are non-returnable and non-refundable unless they are defective or incorrect.</li></ul><p><strong>3. How to Request a Refund or Return</strong></p><p>To request a return or refund at the time of delivery:</p><ol><li><strong>Inspect the Product</strong>: Check the product and packaging carefully at the time of delivery.</li><li><strong>Notify the Delivery Man</strong>: If there are any issues such as damage, defects, or incorrect items, inform the delivery person immediately.</li><li><strong>Return Process</strong>: If the issue is confirmed, the product will be returned, and a refund will be processed.</li><li><strong>Refund Processing</strong>: Refunds will be processed to the original payment method used for the purchase. The processing time may take 7-10 business days.</li></ol><p><strong>4. Refunds After Delivery Acceptance</strong></p><p>Once the product is delivered and accepted, the transaction is considered complete. Refunds or returns are not possible after the delivery has been accepted unless the product is found to be defective or incorrect <strong>at the time of delivery</strong>.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>5. Delivery Issues and Refunds</strong></p><p>In case of delivery-related issues, such as late or non-delivery, please contact Mediboy customer support immediately. Refunds will be processed based on the investigation of the delivery issue.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>6. Changes or Cancellations of Orders</strong></p><p>Once an order is confirmed and processed for delivery, it cannot be changed or canceled. However, users can inspect the product at the time of delivery and return it if there is an issue as per the terms mentioned above.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>7. Modifications to the Refund Policy</strong></p><p>Mediboy reserves the right to update or modify this Refund Policy at any time. Any changes will be posted on the App, and the \"Effective Date\" will be updated accordingly. We encourage users to review this policy regularly to stay informed.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>8. Contact Us</strong></p><p>If you have any questions or concerns regarding our Refund Policy, please contact Mediboy customer support at:</p><p><strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:support@mediboy.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">support@mediboy.com</a></p>', '2025-01-13 20:12:46', '2025-01-22 17:57:46'),
(2, 'privacy policy', '<p>Mediboy (\"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\") is committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring that your personal information is handled in a safe and responsible manner. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and disclose your personal information when you use the Mediboy mobile application (the \"App\") and related services.</p><p>By using the App, you agree to the collection and use of your information in accordance with this Privacy Policy.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>1. Information We Collect</strong></p><p>We collect personal information in the following ways:</p><p><strong>a. Personal Information You Provide</strong></p><p> When you register or use the App, we collect personal information such as:</p><ul><li>Name</li><li>Email address</li><li>Phone number</li><li>Delivery address</li><li>Payment information (processed through secure payment gateways)</li><li>Any other information you provide through forms or customer support</li></ul><p><strong>b. Information We Automatically Collect</strong></p><p> When you use the App, we automatically collect certain information, including:</p><ul><li>Device information (e.g., operating system, device model)</li><li>IP address</li><li>Geolocation data (if location services are enabled)</li><li>App usage information (e.g., browsing and shopping preferences)</li><li>Log data (e.g., crashes, app performance metrics)</li></ul><p><strong>2. How We Use Your Information</strong></p><p>We use the personal information we collect for the following purposes:</p><ul><li>To provide and maintain the App and its services</li><li>To process your orders and payments</li><li>To communicate with you, including sending order confirmations, updates, and promotions</li><li>To personalize your experience and suggest relevant products</li><li>To improve the functionality and performance of the App</li><li>To comply with legal obligations and protect our rights</li><li>To detect and prevent fraud and other illegal activities</li></ul><p><strong>3. How We Share Your Information</strong></p><p>We may share your personal information in the following circumstances:</p><p><strong>a. With Sellers</strong></p><p> When you make a purchase, we may share relevant information (such as your name, address, and order details) with the sellers to process and fulfill your order.</p><p><strong>b. With Service Providers</strong></p><p> We may engage third-party companies and individuals to assist in providing services to you, such as payment processing, delivery, and customer support. These service providers have access to your personal information only to perform specific tasks on our behalf and are obligated not to disclose or use it for any other purpose.</p><p><strong>c. Legal Compliance</strong></p><p> We may disclose your personal information if required by law or in response to valid requests by public authorities (e.g., a court or government agency).</p><p><strong>d. Business Transfers</strong></p><p> If Mediboy is involved in a merger, acquisition, or asset sale, your personal information may be transferred as part of that transaction. We will notify you before any personal information is transferred or becomes subject to a different privacy policy.</p><p><strong>4. Data Retention</strong></p><p>We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy, including for legal, accounting, or reporting requirements. Once your personal information is no longer needed, we will securely delete or anonymize it.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>5. Security of Your Information</strong></p><p>We take the security of your personal information seriously. We use commercially reasonable measures to protect your data from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no method of electronic storage or transmission is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>6. Your Rights and Choices</strong></p><p><strong>a. Access and Update Your Information</strong></p><p> You have the right to access, update, or correct your personal information at any time by logging into your account or contacting us.</p><p><strong>b. Data Deletion</strong></p><p> You can request the deletion of your personal information by contacting us. Please note that certain information may be retained for legal, operational, or business purposes.</p><p><strong>c. Opt-Out of Marketing Communications</strong></p><p> You can opt out of receiving marketing communications by following the unsubscribe instructions in any promotional email or by contacting us directly.</p><p><strong>d. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</strong></p><p> The App uses cookies and similar technologies to enhance your experience. You can control cookie settings through your device settings or browser preferences, but disabling cookies may affect some features of the App.</p><p><strong>7. International Transfers</strong></p><p>Your personal information may be transferred to and maintained on servers located outside your country of residence, including Bangladesh. By using the App, you consent to the transfer of your information to locations outside your jurisdiction, which may have different data protection laws.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>8. Children’s Privacy</strong></p><p>The App is not intended for use by children under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from individuals under 18. If we learn that we have inadvertently collected such information, we will take steps to delete it.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>9. Changes to This Privacy Policy</strong></p><p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any material changes by posting the updated policy on the App and updating the \"Effective Date\" at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically to stay informed about how we are protecting your information.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>10. Contact Us</strong></p><p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at:</p><p><strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:support@mediboy.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">support@mediboy.com</a></p>', '2025-01-13 20:13:00', '2025-01-22 17:52:13'),
(3, 'about us', '<p><strong>Welcome to Mediboy!</strong></p><p>At Mediboy, we are dedicated to making healthcare more accessible and affordable for everyone. We believe that finding the right medicines and healthcare products should be a simple and transparent process, and that’s why we’ve created a platform where users can easily search, compare prices, and purchase from trusted pharmacies and stores in their area.</p><p><strong>Our Mission</strong></p><p>Our mission is to revolutionize the way people access healthcare products by offering a seamless, reliable, and cost-effective way to shop for medicines and healthcare supplies. We aim to empower users by providing them with real-time information on product availability, prices, and special offers from registered sellers.</p><p><strong>How It Works</strong></p><p>Mediboy connects users with local pharmacies and healthcare stores that offer a wide range of products, including prescription medications, over-the-counter drugs, wellness items, and more. Simply search for the products you need, compare prices and offers from different sellers, and choose the best option for your needs.</p><p>Once you make a selection, Mediboy handles the ordering and delivery process, ensuring that your products reach you quickly and safely.</p><p><strong>Why Choose Mediboy?</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Convenience</strong>: Shop for healthcare products from the comfort of your home or anywhere at any time.</li><li><strong>Price Comparison</strong>: Easily compare prices and find the best offers from local pharmacies and stores.</li><li><strong>Trusted Sellers</strong>: We work with certified pharmacies and healthcare providers, ensuring that you receive authentic and high-quality products.</li><li><strong>Secure Transactions</strong>: All payments are processed securely to give you peace of mind during your transactions.</li><li><strong>Fast Delivery</strong>: We partner with trusted delivery services to get your order to you on time.</li></ul><p><strong>Our Vision</strong></p><p>We envision a future where accessing healthcare products is simple, affordable, and reliable for everyone. By bridging the gap between pharmacies and consumers, Mediboy aims to improve health outcomes and make healthcare more accessible across Bangladesh.</p><p><strong>Get in Touch</strong></p><p>Have any questions or need assistance? Our customer support team is here to help! Reach out to us at:</p><p><strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:support@mediboy.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">support@mediboy.com</a></p>', '2025-01-13 20:23:31', '2025-01-22 18:00:29');
