(34, 'Freedom Ultra Wings', 'Super Dry Napkin', 120.00, 1, 'Box', '8 pad\'s in a box', 'Pad', '8 pad\'s', 'no', 'yes', '<p><strong>How to Use a Sanitary Pad:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Choose the right pad:</strong></li><li>Select a sanitary pad that fits your flow (light, moderate, or heavy) and is the appropriate size for your body and activities. There are various options available, including day pads, overnight pads, and panty liners.</li><li><strong>Prepare the pad:</strong></li><li>Remove the sanitary pad from its packaging. If the pad is individually wrapped, unwrap it carefully.</li><li><strong>Placement:</strong></li><li>Stick the adhesive side of the pad to the inside of your underwear, ensuring it is placed securely in the center. Most pads have wings, which should be folded around the sides of your underwear for extra security.</li><li><strong>Wear the pad:</strong></li><li>Adjust the pad as needed to ensure it feels comfortable and stays in place. Make sure the pad covers the area that is most likely to absorb menstrual flow.</li><li><strong>Change regularly:</strong></li><li>Change your pad every 4-6 hours or more often if it becomes saturated to avoid discomfort or leaks. If you experience heavy flow, you may need to change it more frequently.</li><li><strong>Disposal:</strong></li><li>After use, roll up the pad securely with the adhesive strips and dispose of it in a sealed bag or waste bin. Avoid flushing sanitary pads down the toilet as they may clog plumbing.</li></ol><p><strong>Storage Tips for Sanitary Pads:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Keep them in a cool, dry place:</strong>&nbsp;Store pads in their original packaging or in a clean, dry space to avoid exposure to moisture, which could damage the pad.</li><li><strong>Avoid storing pads in a humid environment:</strong>&nbsp;Humidity can compromise the pad’s effectiveness.</li></ul><p><strong>Additional Tips:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Avoid wearing pads for extended periods:</strong>&nbsp;Try not to wear a pad for more than 8 hours at a time to reduce the risk of irritation and infection.</li><li><strong>Use appropriate pad types for your activity:</strong>&nbsp;If you\'re active, consider using pads designed for sports or those with additional features like extra absorbency and comfort.</li></ul><p><br></p>', 'active', '1589_1733574296.webp', 14, 3, NULL, '2024-12-07 17:24:56', '2024-12-07 17:24:56'),
(35, 'Herbalika Dry and Fresh Everyday', 'Sanitary Napkin Sweet Teen Panty Liners', 200.00, 1, 'Box', '20\'s in a box', 'Pad', '20 Liners', 'no', 'yes', '<p><strong>How to Use a Sanitary Pad:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Choose the right pad:</strong></li><li>Select a sanitary pad that fits your flow (light, moderate, or heavy) and is the appropriate size for your body and activities. There are various options available, including day pads, overnight pads, and panty liners.</li><li><strong>Prepare the pad:</strong></li><li>Remove the sanitary pad from its packaging. If the pad is individually wrapped, unwrap it carefully.</li><li><strong>Placement:</strong></li><li>Stick the adhesive side of the pad to the inside of your underwear, ensuring it is placed securely in the center. Most pads have wings, which should be folded around the sides of your underwear for extra security.</li><li><strong>Wear the pad:</strong></li><li>Adjust the pad as needed to ensure it feels comfortable and stays in place. Make sure the pad covers the area that is most likely to absorb menstrual flow.</li><li><strong>Change regularly:</strong></li><li>Change your pad every 4-6 hours or more often if it becomes saturated to avoid discomfort or leaks. If you experience heavy flow, you may need to change it more frequently.</li><li><strong>Disposal:</strong></li><li>After use, roll up the pad securely with the adhesive strips and dispose of it in a sealed bag or waste bin. Avoid flushing sanitary pads down the toilet as they may clog plumbing.</li></ol><p><strong>Storage Tips for Sanitary Pads:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Keep them in a cool, dry place:</strong>&nbsp;Store pads in their original packaging or in a clean, dry space to avoid exposure to moisture, which could damage the pad.</li><li><strong>Avoid storing pads in a humid environment:</strong>&nbsp;Humidity can compromise the pad’s effectiveness.</li></ul><p><strong>Additional Tips:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Avoid wearing pads for extended periods:</strong>&nbsp;Try not to wear a pad for more than 8 hours at a time to reduce the risk of irritation and infection.</li><li><strong>Use appropriate pad types for your activity:</strong>&nbsp;If you\'re active, consider using pads designed for sports or those with additional features like extra absorbency and comfort.</li></ul>', 'active', '318_1733574776.png', 18, 3, NULL, '2024-12-07 17:32:56', '2024-12-07 17:42:31'),
(36, 'Mayapill', 'Ethinyl Estradiol + Levonorgestrel + Ferrous Fumarate', 23.52, 1, 'x 28 tablet\'s strip', '28\'s tablet in a strip', 'Tablet', '0.03 mg+0.15 mg+75 mg', 'no', 'yes', '<p>Mayapill 30 mcg + 150 mcg + 75 mg is an oral contraceptive pill that is used primarily for the prevention of pregnancy. It also helps in regularizing the menstrual cycle and reducing discomforts during menstruation. Here\'s an overview based on the provided information:</p><h3>Indications:</h3><ul><li><strong>Pregnancy Prevention</strong>: Primarily used as a contraceptive to prevent pregnancy.</li><li><strong>Menstrual Regulation</strong>: Helps to regularize the menstrual cycle.</li><li><strong>Relieving Menstrual Discomfort</strong>: Reduces the discomfort experienced during menstruation.</li></ul><p><strong>Therapeutic Class:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Oral Contraceptive Preparations</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Pharmacology:</strong></p><ul><li>Mayapill contains a combination of <strong>Levonorgestrel</strong>, <strong>Ethinylestradiol</strong>, and <strong>Ferrous Fumarate</strong>.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>Levonorgestrel</strong> (a progestin) and <strong>Ethinylestradiol</strong> (an estrogen) together inhibit ovulation by modulating pituitary secretion of gonadotropins (luteinizing hormone and follicle-stimulating hormone).</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>Ferrous Fumarate</strong> is an iron supplement that helps prevent or treat iron deficiency, commonly associated with menstruation.</li></ul><p><strong>Dosage &amp; Administration:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Daily Dosing</strong>: Take one pill daily for 28 days, starting on the first day of menstruation.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>First 21 Pills</strong>: White active pills.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>Last 7 Pills</strong>: Brown iron pills, taken during menstruation.</li><li><strong>Missed Pill</strong>: If a dose is missed within 24 hours, take the missed pill as soon as possible. If vomiting occurs within 4 hours of taking the pill, it may not be absorbed, and the woman should take an extra pill from a backup pack.</li><li><strong>Delaying Menstruation</strong>: If you want to delay your period, start the next pack immediately after finishing the white active pills of the current pack, skipping the brown inactive pills.</li></ul><p><strong>Interactions:</strong></p><ul><li>Certain medications, such as <strong>antibiotics</strong> (ampicillin, tetracyclines), and <strong>anticonvulsants</strong> (phenytoin, rifampicin), may decrease the effectiveness of Mayapill.</li><li>If these interactions occur, a non-hormonal backup method of contraception is recommended.</li></ul><p><strong>Contraindications:</strong></p><p>Mayapill should <strong>not</strong> be used by:</p><ul><li>Pregnant women</li><li>Women over 45 years old or heavy smokers (more than 20 cigarettes a day)</li><li>Those with a history of <strong>heart disease</strong>, <strong>blood clotting issues</strong>, <strong>liver disease</strong>, <strong>high blood pressure</strong>, <strong>diabetes with vascular complications</strong>, or unexplained bleeding</li><li>Hypersensitivity to any of the components</li></ul><p><strong>Side Effects:</strong></p><p>Common side effects in the initial stages may include:</p><ul><li>Dizziness</li><li>Headache</li><li>Nausea</li><li>Intermenstrual bleeding After 2-3 months, these side effects typically go away. If they persist, consult a doctor.</li></ul><p>Serious side effects requiring medical attention:</p><ul><li>Migraines</li><li>Vision or speech changes</li><li>Pain or swelling in legs</li><li>Chest pain, shortness of breath</li><li>Yellow skin, rise in blood pressure</li></ul><p><strong>Pregnancy &amp; Lactation:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Pregnancy</strong>: Mayapill is contraindicated during pregnancy. If pregnancy occurs while using the pill, discontinue use immediately.</li><li><strong>Lactation</strong>: The use of estrogen-containing contraceptives can affect lactation and may reduce milk quantity and quality. It\'s advised to avoid them until the infant is weaned.</li></ul><h3>Precautions &amp; Warnings:</h3><ul><li>Some medications, such as <strong>antibiotics</strong> and <strong>anticonvulsants</strong>, may interfere with the effectiveness of Mayapill.</li><li>A non-hormonal backup contraception method may be required during such interactions.</li></ul><p><strong>Overdose:</strong></p><p>Symptoms of overdose may include:</p><ul><li>Nausea, vomiting, dizziness, abdominal pain, breast tenderness, drowsiness, and fatigue. Withdrawal bleeding may also occur.</li><li>No specific antidote exists, and treatment is symptomatic.</li></ul><p><strong>Storage:</strong></p><ul><li>Store at <strong>15°C to 30°C</strong> in a dry place, away from light.</li><li>Keep out of reach of children.</li></ul><p>This comprehensive approach ensures that Mayapill is used safely and effectively for its intended purpose. Always consult a healthcare provider for personalized advice and any potential concerns.</p>', 'active', '121_1733575285.webp', 5, 3, NULL, '2024-12-07 17:41:25', '2024-12-14 21:09:14'),
(37, 'Menstrual cup reusable for women hygiene during period anytime betterhealth', 'Menstrual Cup', 1050.00, 1, 'Pack', '1 pack', 'Cup', 'small', 'no', 'yes', '<p>A <strong>menstrual cup</strong> is a reusable, eco-friendly alternative to traditional period products like pads and tampons. It\'s designed to be inserted into the vagina to collect menstrual blood during a woman\'s period. Here\'s a comprehensive look at menstrual cups and their benefits for women\'s hygiene:</p><p><strong>What is a Menstrual Cup?</strong></p><ul><li>A menstrual cup is a flexible, bell-shaped cup typically made from <strong>medical-grade silicone, rubber, or elastomer</strong>.</li><li>It is inserted into the vagina to collect menstrual fluid instead of absorbing it like tampons or pads.</li></ul><p><strong>Benefits of Using a Menstrual Cup:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Eco-Friendly:</strong></li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Menstrual cups are <strong>reusable</strong> and can last for years with proper care, significantly reducing waste compared to single-use products like tampons and pads.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Cost-Effective:</strong></li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Although the initial cost is higher than a box of tampons or pads, a menstrual cup can last for <strong>several years</strong>, making it more economical in the long term.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Longer Wear Time:</strong></li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">A menstrual cup can be worn for <strong>up to 12 hours</strong> at a time, depending on your flow. This is longer than pads or tampons, making it more convenient for work, travel, or overnight use.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Healthier Option:</strong></li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Menstrual cups don\'t contain chemicals, fragrances, or bleaches that are often found in some tampons and pads. This makes them a safer option for women with sensitive skin or those prone to irritation.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Reduced Risk of Toxic Shock Syndrome (TSS):</strong></li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">While TSS is rare, it is primarily associated with tampons. Since menstrual cups don’t absorb blood but collect it, the risk of TSS is lower compared to tampons.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Better for Active Lifestyles:</strong></li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Because menstrual cups fit securely inside the vagina, they can be worn during <strong>physical activities</strong> such as swimming, exercise, and sports without the risk of leaks.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Discreet and Comfortable:</strong></li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Once inserted properly, the menstrual cup is <strong>virtually invisible and feels comfortable</strong>, offering no bulk or discomfort. It also prevents any odor because it collects rather than absorbs the menstrual fluid.</li></ul><p><strong>How to Use a Menstrual Cup:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Fold the Cup</strong>: Before insertion, fold the menstrual cup in a specific way (such as the \"C-fold\" or \"punch-down fold\") to make it easier to insert.</li><li><strong>Insert the Cup</strong>: Gently insert the folded cup into the vagina. Once inside, it will unfold and form a seal against the vaginal walls to prevent leaks.</li><li><strong>Remove the Cup</strong>: After 6-12 hours, wash your hands, squat or sit comfortably, and gently pull on the stem of the cup to remove it. Tip the contents into the toilet, rinse the cup with water, and reinsert it.</li><li><strong>Clean the Cup</strong>: After each period, sterilize the cup by boiling it in water for a few minutes to ensure it’s thoroughly cleaned.</li></ol><p><strong>Considerations:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Initial Learning Curve</strong>: Some women may find it challenging to insert or remove the cup at first. It may take some practice to find the best fold and insertion technique for comfort.</li><li><strong>Size &amp; Fit</strong>: Menstrual cups come in different sizes based on factors like age, childbirth, and flow. Choosing the right size is important for comfort and leakage prevention.</li><li><strong>Hygiene</strong>: It\'s important to maintain proper hygiene by cleaning the cup thoroughly after each use to avoid infections.</li><li><strong>Not Suitable for Everyone</strong>: Women with certain medical conditions, like vaginal prolapse, or those who are not comfortable inserting objects into the vagina may find menstrual cups less suitable.</li></ul><p><strong>Tips for Better Use:</strong></p><ul><li>Always ensure the cup is inserted properly to prevent leaks.</li><li>If you experience any discomfort, make sure the cup is fully unfolded and positioned correctly.</li><li>Avoid using the cup if you have recently had a pelvic infection or surgery—consult with your doctor first.</li><li>Ensure you clean the cup thoroughly with mild, unscented soap and water to avoid irritation.</li></ul><p><strong>Conclusion:</strong></p><p>A menstrual cup can be a great option for women who are looking for a sustainable, cost-effective, and comfortable solution for menstrual hygiene. It provides long-lasting protection, is easy to use once you get the hang of it, and offers multiple health benefits. However, like any product, it’s important to find what works best for your body and lifestyle. If you\'re new to menstrual cups, give yourself time to learn and adapt to their use.</p>', 'active', '1249_1733575698.webp', 19, 3, NULL, '2024-12-07 17:48:18', '2024-12-07 17:49:39'),
(38, 'Herbalika Bliss Night', 'Sanitary Napkin', 190.00, 1, 'Box', '8 pad\'s in a box', 'Pad', '8 pad\'s', 'no', 'yes', '<p>Stay confident and worry-free on your heavy flow days with Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Pads. Its advanced features keep you dry, fresh and comfortable. The pad’s interior instantly absorbs and evenly distributes fluid. Also, it has an extra layer of protection to prevent back leakage.</p><p><strong>Usage Instructions Of Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Pads:</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Choose the right size and absorbency for your flow.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Apply the Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Pads to your underwear, with the adhesive side down.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Secure the Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Pads in place by folding the wings down.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Change the Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Pads every 4 to 6 hours, or more often if it becomes wet or soiled.</span></li></ul><p><strong>Storage Guidelines Of Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Pads:</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Store Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Padss in a cool and dry place.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Do not store Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Padss in a humid environment.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Keep Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Padss out of reach of children.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Do not store used Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Padss.</span></li></ul><p><strong>Safety Information:</strong></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Choose the right size and absorbency for your flow.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Secure the Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Pads in place by folding the wings down.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Change the Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Pads every 4 to 6 hours, or more often if it becomes wet or soiled.</span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dispose of the used Herbalika Bliss Night 8 Pads in a sealed bag or container.</span></li></ul><p><br></p>', 'active', '1917_1733576523.jpg', 18, 3, NULL, '2024-12-07 18:02:03', '2024-12-07 18:02:03'),
(39, 'Sensation Super Dotted Strawberry Condoms', 'Condom', 40.00, 1, 'Box', '3\'s pack in box', 'Condom', '1x3\'s pack', 'no', 'yes', '<p><strong>Sensation Super Dotted Strawberry Condoms</strong> are designed to enhance your intimate moments while ensuring maximum protection. Here\'s a detailed guide on how to use, store, and handle them:</p><p><strong>Product Features:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Maximum Protection</strong>: Offers reliable protection against unwanted pregnancies and sexually transmitted diseases (STDs).</li><li><strong>High-Quality Material</strong>: Made from high-grade latex for durability and strength.</li><li><strong>Comfort and Pleasure</strong>: Natural-feeling lubrication for both partners’ comfort.</li><li><strong>Rigorously Tested</strong>: Meets international safety standards for quality assurance.</li></ul><p><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Before Intercourse</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Ensure the condom is unexpired and in good condition.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Place the condom on the erect genital just before sexual intercourse.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Confirm that the rolled edge of the condom is on the outside.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Squeeze the tip of the condom to release any trapped air before putting it on.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Putting the Condom On</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Hold the squeezed end and place the condom on top of the erect genital.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Use one hand to hold the tip and the other to roll the condom down to the base of the genital.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>After Ejaculation</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">After ejaculation, while the genital is still erect, hold the base of the condom firmly.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Carefully remove the condom, ensuring no spillage.</li></ul><p><strong>Safety Information:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Expiry Date</strong>: Always check the expiry date before use to ensure effectiveness.</li><li><strong>Single-Use Only</strong>: These condoms are designed for one-time use only—do not reuse them.</li><li><strong>Packaging</strong>: Avoid using sharp objects to open the condom packet, as this can damage the condom.</li></ul><p><strong>Precautions &amp; Warnings:</strong></p><ul><li>Always inspect the condom before use to ensure there are no damages or holes.</li><li>Never use expired condoms, as their protective qualities may be compromised.</li><li>If you feel any irritation or discomfort, discontinue use and consult a healthcare provider.</li></ul><p><strong>Storage Conditions:</strong></p><ul><li>Store the condoms in a <strong>cool</strong> (below 30°C), <strong>dry</strong> place.</li><li>Keep them <strong>shielded from sunlight</strong> and avoid storing in places where they could be exposed to extreme temperatures or humidity (e.g., car interiors, bathroom).</li></ul><p><strong>Disposal</strong>:</p><ul><li>Dispose of used condoms properly—do not flush them down the toilet to avoid blockages or environmental harm.</li></ul><p>By following these instructions, Sensation Super Dotted Strawberry Condoms can provide you with a pleasurable and safe experience. Always ensure proper storage, check expiry dates, and handle with care for optimal protection.</p>', 'active', '1602_1733582070.png', 12, 4, NULL, '2024-12-07 19:34:30', '2024-12-07 19:47:16'),
(40, 'Panther Dotted Condoms', 'Condom', 25.00, 1, 'Box', '3\'s pack in box', 'Condom', '3\'s pack', 'no', 'yes', '<p>Panther Dotted Condoms ensures your peace of mind and lets you enjoy intimate moments. This Panther Dotted Condoms is designed to provide maximum protection while balancing safety and sensitivity. They are made with high-grade, durable latex to guarantee protection against unwanted pregnancies and sexually transmitted diseases. Both partners experience comfort and pleasure thanks to the natural-feeling lubrication. Rigorously tested to meet international safety standards.</p><p><strong>Usage Instructions Of Panther Dotted Condoms :</strong></p><ul><li>Place the Panther Dotted Condoms on the erect genital just before sexual intercourse.</li><li>Ensure that the roll of the Panther Dotted Condoms is on the outside.</li><li>Squeeze the end of the Panther Dotted Condoms to release any trapped air before putting it on.</li><li>With one hand, put the Panther Dotted Condoms on top of the genital while still squeezing the end, and roll it down with the other hand.</li><li>After ejaculation, while the genital is still erect, hold the Panther Dotted Condoms firmly at the base and carefully remove it.</li></ul><p><strong>Safety Information:</strong></p><ul><li>Ensure the Panther Dotted Condoms is within its expiry date for optimal effectiveness.</li><li>The Panther Dotted Condoms is designed for single use only. Never reuse a Panther Dotted Condoms .</li><li>Avoid using sharp objects to open the packaging as it can damage the Panther Dotted Condoms .</li><li>Dispose of used Panther Dotted Condoms s responsibly. Do not flush them down the toilet.</li></ul><p><strong>Precautions &amp; Warnings:</strong></p><ul><li>Open the package carefully, avoiding the use of sharp objects that could potentially damage the Panther Dotted Condoms .</li><li>Always check the expiry date before use. Expired Panther Dotted Condoms s may not provide effective protection.</li></ul><p><strong>Storage Conditions:</strong></p><ul><li>Ensure Panther Dotted Condoms s are stored in a cool (below 30°C), dry place, shielded from sunlight.</li></ul>', 'active', '1000_1733582767.webp', 12, 4, NULL, '2024-12-07 19:46:07', '2024-12-07 19:47:27'),
(41, 'U & ME Long Love Condoms', 'Condom', 70.00, 1, 'Box', '3\'s pack in box', 'Condom', '3\'s pack', 'no', 'yes', '<p><br></p><p><strong>U &amp; ME Long Love Condoms</strong> are designed to provide a balance of safety, comfort, and pleasure for both partners, ensuring peace of mind during intimate moments. Below is a comprehensive guide on their usage, storage, and safety information:</p><p><strong>Product Features:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Maximum Protection</strong>: Offers reliable protection against unwanted pregnancies and sexually transmitted diseases (STDs).</li><li><strong>High-Grade Latex</strong>: Made from durable latex to guarantee protection and comfort.</li><li><strong>Natural Lubrication</strong>: Features natural-feeling lubrication that enhances comfort and pleasure for both partners.</li><li><strong>International Safety Standards</strong>: Rigorously tested to meet global safety standards for your peace of mind.</li></ul><p><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Before Intercourse</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Check the expiry date to ensure effectiveness.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Place the condom on the erect genital just before sexual intercourse.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Ensure the roll of the condom is on the outside.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Applying the Condom</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Squeeze the tip of the condom to release any trapped air before putting it on.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">With one hand, hold the tip and place the condom on top of the genital, while rolling it down with the other hand.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>After Ejaculation</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">After ejaculation, while the genital is still erect, hold the condom firmly at the base.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Carefully remove the condom to avoid any spillage.</li></ul><p><strong>Safety Information:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Expiry Date</strong>: Always check the expiry date before use to ensure optimal protection.</li><li><strong>Single Use</strong>: Designed for one-time use only. Do not reuse a condom.</li><li><strong>Opening the Packaging</strong>: Avoid using sharp objects to open the condom packet to prevent damage.</li><li><strong>Proper Disposal</strong>: Dispose of the used condom responsibly. Do not flush it down the toilet.</li></ul><p><strong>Precautions &amp; Warnings:</strong></p><ul><li>Always check the condom before use for any visible damage.</li><li>Expired condoms may not provide effective protection—do not use them.</li><li>If you experience any discomfort, irritation, or adverse reactions, discontinue use and consult a healthcare provider.</li></ul><p><strong>Storage Conditions:</strong></p><ul><li>Store condoms in a <strong>cool</strong> (below 30°C), <strong>dry</strong> place, away from direct sunlight or heat sources.</li><li>Keep condoms in a location where they will not be exposed to excessive humidity or temperature changes, as this may weaken the latex.</li></ul><p><strong>Conclusion:</strong></p><p>By following these instructions, <strong>U &amp; ME Long Love Condoms</strong> offer a secure, comfortable, and pleasurable experience. Always ensure proper handling, check for expiry, and dispose of them responsibly for optimal protection.</p>', 'active', '63_1733583948.jpg', 12, 4, NULL, '2024-12-07 20:05:48', '2024-12-07 20:05:48'),
(42, 'Amore Luxury Condoms Gold', 'Condom', 100.00, 1, 'Box', '3\'s pack in box', 'Condom', '3\'s pack', 'no', 'yes', '<p><strong>Amore Luxury Condoms Gold</strong> are designed to offer both protection and pleasure, providing a secure and enjoyable experience for both partners. Here\'s a detailed guide on how to use, store, and handle them:</p><p><strong>Product Features:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Maximum Protection</strong>: Provides reliable protection against unwanted pregnancies and sexually transmitted diseases (STDs).</li><li><strong>Durable Latex</strong>: Made from high-grade, durable latex for strength and reliability.</li><li><strong>Natural Lubrication</strong>: The lubrication offers a natural, comfortable feel, enhancing pleasure for both partners.</li><li><strong>International Safety Standards</strong>: Rigorously tested to meet global safety standards for your peace of mind.</li></ul><p><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Before Intercourse</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Always check the expiry date to ensure the condom is effective.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Place the condom on the erect genital just before sexual intercourse.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Ensure that the roll of the condom is on the outside.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Applying the Condom</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Squeeze the tip of the condom to release any trapped air before putting it on.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">With one hand, hold the tip and place the condom on top of the genital, then roll it down with the other hand.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>After Ejaculation</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">After ejaculation, while the genital is still erect, hold the base of the condom firmly.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Carefully remove the condom to prevent any spillage.</li></ul><p><strong>Safety Information:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Expiry Date</strong>: Always check the expiry date before use to ensure optimal protection and effectiveness.</li><li><strong>Single Use</strong>: These condoms are designed for single use only—never reuse them.</li><li><strong>Opening the Packaging</strong>: Avoid using sharp objects to open the packaging to prevent damage to the condom.</li><li><strong>Proper Disposal</strong>: Dispose of used condoms responsibly. Do not flush them down the toilet.</li></ul><p><strong>Precautions &amp; Warnings:</strong></p><ul><li>Open the package carefully, ensuring that no sharp objects are used to avoid damaging the condom.</li><li>Always check the expiry date before use. Using expired condoms may reduce their effectiveness.</li><li>If you experience discomfort, irritation, or any adverse effects, discontinue use and consult a healthcare provider.</li></ul><p><strong>Storage Conditions:</strong></p><ul><li>Store condoms in a <strong>cool</strong> (below 30°C), <strong>dry</strong> place, away from sunlight and heat sources.</li><li>Keep them in a place where they will not be exposed to extreme temperatures or humidity, as this could weaken the latex.</li></ul><p><strong>Conclusion:</strong></p><p>By following these instructions, <strong>Amore Luxury Condoms Gold</strong> can provide a pleasurable and safe experience. Ensure you check the expiry date, store them properly, and dispose of used condoms responsibly for maximum protection and comfort.</p>', 'active', '1733_1733584439.png', 12, 4, NULL, '2024-12-07 20:13:59', '2024-12-07 20:13:59'),
