(46, 'Carex condoms', 'Condom', 40.00, 1, 'Box', '3\'s pack in box', 'Condom', '3\'s pack', 'no', 'yes', '<p><strong>Carex Condoms</strong> are designed to provide maximum protection while ensuring comfort and sensitivity during intimate moments. Here is a comprehensive guide on how to use, store, and handle them for a safe and enjoyable experience:</p><p><strong>Product Features:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Maximum Protection</strong>: Provides reliable protection against unwanted pregnancies and sexually transmitted diseases (STDs).</li><li><strong>Durable Latex</strong>: Made from high-quality, durable latex for strength and reliability.</li><li><strong>Natural Lubrication</strong>: The natural-feeling lubrication enhances comfort and pleasure for both partners.</li><li><strong>Safety Standards</strong>: Rigorously tested to meet international safety standards.</li></ul><p><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Before Intercourse</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Always check the expiry date to ensure the condom is still effective.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Place the condom on the erect genital just before sexual intercourse.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Ensure the roll of the condom is on the outside.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>Applying the Condom</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Squeeze the tip of the condom to release any trapped air before putting it on.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">With one hand, hold the tip and place the condom on top of the genital. Use the other hand to roll it down the shaft.</li></ul><ol><li><strong>After Ejaculation</strong>:</li></ol><ul><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">After ejaculation, while the genital is still erect, hold the base of the condom firmly.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\">Carefully remove the condom to avoid any spillage.</li></ul><p><strong>Safety Information:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Expiry Date</strong>: Always check the expiry date before use to ensure maximum effecti