i><li><strong style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Lipid-lowering therapies</strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">: Combining with fibrates or niacin increases the risk of muscle-related side effects.</span></li></ul><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Contraindications</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Rocovas 5 mg is contraindicated in:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Hypersensitivity to any of its components.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Liver disease, including unexplained persistent elevation of hepatic transaminases.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Pregnant women or women planning to conceive.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Nursing mothers.</span></li></ul><p><strong style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Side Effects</strong></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Rocovas 5 mg is generally well-tolerated. Common side effects include:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Headache</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Myalgia</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Constipation</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Asthenia</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Abdominal pain</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\">Nausea</span></li></ul><p><br></p>', 'active', '685_1738350743.jpg', 4, 12, NULL, '2025-02-01 00:12:23', '2025-02-01 00:12:23'),
