eres with Cutin 5000 mcg absorption.</li></ul><p><strong>Contraindications</strong></p><ul><li>Contraindicated in patients with known hypersensitivity to any of the ingredients.</li></ul><p><strong>Pregnancy &amp; Lactation</strong></p><ul><li>Sufficient clinical data is not available to use in pregnant women and lactating mothers.</li></ul><p><strong>Storage Conditions</strong></p><ul><li>Store in a cool and dry place, away from light and moisture.</li><li>Keep out of reach of children.</li></ul><p><br></p>', 'active', '1865_1742125201.webp', 44, 12, NULL, '2025-03-16 16:40:01', '2025-03-16 16:40:01'),
