(4604, 'Vitaforce-S', 'Super antioxidant [vitamins & minerals]', 4.00, 30, 'pot', '30 tablet in a pot', 'Tablet', 'N/A', 'yes', 'no', '<p><strong>Indications</strong></p><p> Vitaforce-S is indicated in the following cases:</p><ul><li>To develop the immune system.</li><li>To prevent well-known deficiency diseases such as scurvy, beriberi, pellagra, and others.</li><li>To prevent certain types of cancer by blocking the formation of cancer-causing substances in the body.</li><li>It is also capable of combating cardiovascular and immunological disorders.</li><li>To prevent aging.</li><li> <em>রেজিস্টার্ড চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ মোতাবেক ঔষধ সেবন করুন</em></li></ul><p><strong>Composition</strong></p><p> Each tablet contains:</p><ul><li>Vitamin A: 2000 IU</li><li>Vitamin C: 200 mg</li><li>Vitamin E: 50 IU</li><li>Vitamin K: 75 mcg</li><li>Zinc: 15 mg</li><li>Selenium: 70 mcg</li><li>Copper: 1 mg</li><li>Manganese: 3 mg</li></ul><p><strong>Pharmacology</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Vitamin A</strong>: Essential for vision, cell development, and immunity. Its role in immunity contributes to its anti-cancer properties.</li><li><strong>Vitamin C</strong>: Plays a primary role in collagen formation, important for the growth and repair of cells, gums, blood vessels, bones, and teeth. It helps in faster recovery after surgery or trauma and acts as an antioxidant.</li><li><strong>Vitamin E</strong>: A fat-soluble antioxidant that prevents oxidation of fat compounds, working in synergy with Selenium.</li><li><strong>Vitamin K</strong>: Key anti-aging vitamin, preventing heart disease and osteoporosis.</li><li><strong>Zinc</strong>: Rejuvenates the shrinking thymus gland involved in immune function and is a co-factor in over 100 enzymes.</li><li><strong>Selenium</strong>: A potent antioxidant with capabilities to prevent aging and hardening of tissues. It works synergistically with Vitamin E.</li><li><strong>Copper</strong>: An important co-factor for enzymes in the body, acting as part of the endogenous antioxidant system.</li><li><strong>Manganese</strong>: Required to form Super Oxide Dismutase (SOD), an enzyme that protects against cell-damaging free radicals.</li></ul><p><strong>Dosage &amp; Administration</strong></p><ul><li>The adult dose is 1 (one) tablet daily or as prescribed by the physician.</li><li> <em>রেজিস্টার্ড চিকিৎসকের পরামর্শ মোতাবেক ঔষধ সেবন করুন</em></li></ul><p><strong>Contraindications</strong></p><p> This product is contraindicated in patients with a known hypersensitivity to any of the ingredients.</p><p><strong>Side Effects</strong></p><ul><li>Generally well-tolerated.</li><li>Diarrhea may occasionally occur due to beta carotene, and the skin may show a slight yellow discoloration. These side effects of Vitamin A are reversible.</li><li>Vitamin C and Vitamin E may cause diarrhea and other gastrointestinal disturbances.</li></ul><p><strong>Pregnancy &amp; Lactation</strong></p><p> This preparation is recommended during pregnancy and lactation.</p><p><strong>Overdose Effects</strong></p><p> In case of accidental overdose, contact a doctor or poison control center immediately.</p><p><strong>Therapeutic Class</strong></p><p> Multi-vitamin &amp; Multi-mineral combined preparations</p><p><strong>Storage Conditions</strong></p><p> Keep below 30°C, away from light and moisture. Keep out of the reach of children.</p>', 'active', '1848_1742845107.jpg', 69, 12, 'mahidsiam1@gmail.com', '2025-03-25 00:38:27', '2025-03-25 00:38:27'),
